md-viewer (@VERSION@) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix startup on systems where GTK4 is installed alongside GTK3 by explicitly
    requiring the GTK3, Gdk3, and GdkPixbuf introspection namespaces before import.
  * Report the same application version in the Python package, Debian package,
    npm metadata, and rendered WebView bundle.
  * Keep the Debian runtime dependencies on Python-GI, GTK3, and WebKit2GTK so
    apt installs any missing dependencies automatically.

